      },
      "writtenOn": "2024-10-07T20:55:29Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I\u0027m not aware of any specific partner that approaches the upper edge of tSenderResponse (which would be a non-compliant partner), and I don\u0027t see any historical evidence of us increasing this value to improve interop. But I can imagine a partner where decreasing it would worsen interop, and I\u0027m a little curious what is the maximum value that still lets us pass TEST.PD.PROT.SRC.2.",
